<title>SPAIN: TABLE-Cepsa H1 net profit rises 24 percen.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Cepsa H1 net profit rises 24 percen.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spain's energy group in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit			   16.82    vs   11.07</p>
<p> Net taxed				 11.43    vs    9.19</p>
<p> Turnover				 610.00    vs  547.77</p>
<p> Operating result			22.22    vs   16.61</p>
<p>Breakdown by business sector:</p>
<p> Oil					 13.57    vs    7.88</p>
<p> Petrochemicals			   8.64    vs    8.72</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
